# Icons and images

Home Assistant uses repeated visual recognition. Icons, device images, room photos, weather symbols and camera feeds can support real tasks.


## Distinguish illustration from interface imagery

Use the [illustration guide](illustration.html) for authored explanatory artwork. Its flat visual language does not remove functional icon strokes, chart patterns, photographs or camera imagery. Use the [accessible content guide](../content/accessible-content.html) for alternatives and reading order.


